{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29547","headline":"瑶池 · 李商隐","name":"瑶池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瑶池阿母绮窗开，黄竹歌声动地哀。\n八骏日行三万里，穆王何事不重来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29547.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29547","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据刘学锴《唐诗鉴赏辞典》“瑶池”条（上海辞书出版社，1983 年版）、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"据刘学锴《唐诗鉴赏辞典》“瑶池”条（上海辞书出版社，1983 年版）"}